<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has secured Bakori and Sali while repelling attacks in the Blue Nile, and it has replaced the 4th Infantry Division commander in Ed Damazin. Ethiopian fighters are being recruited into the Sudanese army and Tigrayan fighters have been drawn into the conflict, while the army arrested former ruling party leader Ahmed Haroun after his podcast appearance. Millions of civilians fleeing the war face shelter shortages as UN funds run low and famine looms, with parents struggling to feed their children. The conflict caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNdjFUeFRoaWdwVmxiMU5SUFR2X09CSDFDSFk0UWVGS3pLRHNKbl9TMEc4VEhMZWZTdk8zREJRYUFmUy0tQUF1bld3cGFjM3kzYW1SQ1Y2T2g4TkpsSW5KMjJ0WUkwS3BiZFJIVXV1U0gyczcwRXZCWTIwTFVNeDB4QXBGY2podXpPbGFHaEJTZm5Ra09mb3I2S0xHcUNEWHdWZTNSTXZVeXZBUXlKNEZ2d2tGd2ZCQ0ct?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBpUkJMUXd2ZnU1ajhQY05SMTh6SUp3TDZ2aERkbU9GUjBoWDJ5RmRsQ2dieFJJWkx0RVY5YmlodTNIWU5RVFVRRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPYjR1cWtHVm9uR2xRalNTU0ltTEdEdHczN2tac0t5QkZuUk9KejQ4NlRxbGxsVVNfTXQ1M0M0Ri1nMHVsWjVuM1RXcElxSnNOcjcyTDBvRkY5T1hldEhJd1prdURaNlZKdUpHRTRFS3RpMWV2T2hvRmo3VnM2T0lXM2oxZEkyY2FiTElmYzIyM1ZBYVJIckp0eUlhenFhWEJweEJr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Citizen Digital&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE51Z0lVYjlFZkVFQTJoTUlPLXlFUVVhOHdwcTRCMEp0X083VjFHOVJGZFhRTWxyM1NGZDVqVFN2WTlTdm5jUkV1R3MtQ0dvckRH?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: